      "title": "Why we built this site",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why we built this site"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "This page is for the owner of Moore Heating & Cooling."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What the customer can do"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Someone in Lebanon whose air conditioner is not cooling, or whose heat is out, can call (417) 588-8822 and choose AC repair or furnace repair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "That number is on the primary Google Maps profile for this business at 22 Glenridge St, observed September 30, 2026 at 21:32 UTC. The pages do not promise hours, a tested call, or a time when someone will answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the pages are split this way"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The homepage introduces Moore Heating & Cooling as the HVAC contractor and sends cooling and heating to their own pages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The AC page asks what the cooling is doing, when it started, and for the customer's service address. The comment on that page is a plain explanation of a system. It does not describe an air-conditioner repair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The furnace page quotes one winter story through the completed installation sentence: the heat went out, it was restored for the time being, and a new unit was installed later. The same-day wording stays inside that quotation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "22 Glenridge St is the listed business address. The pages do not send the customer there for the repair, and they do not invite a walk-in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The comment kept off the sales pages"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "One complaint stays here. It is not used as a price."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Lie about how much the up keep cost, say 100$ yearly for filters then say 700$ when comes time to change filters"
            }
          ],
          "attribution": "1 out of 5, 2024-11-13",
          "reviewId": "review-moore-2024-11-13"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The comment names 100$ yearly for filters, then 700$ when the filters were changed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What the quotes are"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Each quote keeps the star rating and date. Reviewer names were not shown. Eight comments were on the display. The profile count is 11. This is not the full set."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Still open"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Hours and email were not confirmed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The profile showed Add website. That does not prove there is no website."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Does the winter heating story match how you want furnace work described?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Do you want the filter-cost comment answered before this copy is accepted?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
